From 99ea3e343b394ef4194774a62e87f36ac92b3104 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nova <361320585+q2-nova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:29:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] clk: ingenic: port the X2000 CGU driver

Port Zhou Yanjie's X2000 clock driver from Ingenic-community/linux
91fe78280ac7dd0dae0f58cb271e821bd39ba97e (v6.1.y), preserving its headers.
Adapt the clock APIs to Linux 7.3. This is an emulator-tested development
port; clock-rate changes and hardware power management need validation.
